<title>UK: GOLF-ALFRED DUNHILL CUP COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-ALFRED DUNHILL CUP COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ST ANDREWS, Scotland 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated first day</p>
<p>results in the Alfred Dunhill Cup team golf championship on</p>
<p>Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Group one:</p>
<p>1-United States beat Italy 2-1 (U.S. names first)</p>
<p>Mark O'Meara 63 beat Costantino Rocca 70</p>
<p>Phil Mickelson 72 lost to Emanuele Canonica 72 at 20th</p>
<p>Steve Stricker 68 beat Silvio Grappasonni 75</p>
<p>England beat 8-Spain 3-0</p>
<p>Lee Westwood 69 beat Ignacio Garrido 77</p>
<p>Jonathan Lomas 70 beat Miguel Angel Jimenez 71</p>
<p>Barry Lane 69 beat Diego Borrego 76</p>
<p>Group two:</p>
<p>4-Zimbabwe beat India 2-1 (Zimbabwe names first)</p>
<p>Tony Johnstone 73 lost to Ali Sher 72</p>
<p>Mark McNulty 70 beat Gaurav Ghei 73</p>
<p>Nick Price 70 beat Jeev Singh 71</p>
<p>Sweden beat 5-Scotland 2-1 (Swedish names first)</p>
<p>Peter Hedblom 70 lost to Andrew Coltart 67</p>
<p>Patrik Sjoland 68 beat Raymond Russell 69</p>
<p>Jarmo Sandelin 68 beat Colin Montgomerie 69</p>
<p>Group three:</p>
<p>3-South Africa beat Canada 2-1 (South African names first)</p>
<p>Wayne Westner 68 beat Rick Todd 77</p>
<p>Ernie Els 65 beat Rick Gibson 73</p>
<p>Retief Goosen 76 lost to Jim Rutledge 69</p>
<p>6-Ireland beat Wales 2-1 (Irish names first)</p>
<p>Darren Clarke 71 lost to Mark Mouland 70</p>
<p>Paul McGinley 68 beat Paul Affleck 70</p>
<p>Padraig Harrington 70 beat Phillip Price 74</p>
<p>Group four:</p>
<p>2-Australia beat Japan 2-1 (Australian names first)</p>
<p>Wayne Riley 71 lost to Naomichi &quot;Joe&quot; Ozaki 67</p>
<p>Steve Elkington 68 beat Kazuhiro Takami 74</p>
<p>Greg Norman 72 beat Hajime Meshiai 74</p>
<p>7-New Zealand beat Germany 2-1 (New Zealand names first)</p>
<p>Grant Waite 69 beat Heinz-Peter Thuel 69 at 22nd</p>
<p>Greg Turner 74 lost to Thomas Gogele 71</p>
<p>Frank Nobilo 66 beat Sven Struver 71</p>
<p>Tee-off times for Friday's matches (times GMT):</p>
<p>Group four:</p>
<p>7-New Zealand v Japan</p>
<p>0800  Nobilo v Ozaki</p>
<p>0810  Waite  v Meshiai</p>
<p>0820  Turner v Takami</p>
<p>2-Australia v Germany</p>
<p>0830  Riley  v Thuel</p>
<p>0840  Norman v Struver</p>
<p>0850  Elkington v Gogele</p>
<p>Group one:</p>
<p>1-United States v England</p>
<p>0900  O'Meara v Lane</p>
<p>0910  Stricker v Lomas</p>
<p>0920  Mickelson v Westwood</p>
<p>8-Spain v Italy</p>
<p>0930  Jimenez v Grappasonni</p>
<p>0940  Garrido v Canonica</p>
<p>0950  Borrego v Rocca</p>
<p>Group three:</p>
<p>6-Ireland v Canada</p>
<p>1000  Clarke v Gibson</p>
<p>1010  Harrington v Todd</p>
<p>1020  McGinley v Rutledge</p>
<p>3-South Africa v Wales</p>
<p>1030  Goosen v Price</p>
<p>1040  Els v Mouland</p>
<p>1050  Westner v Affleck</p>
<p>Group two:</p>
